## 4. Ring / buffering policy

| Depth | Role |
| --- | --- |
| **2** (minimum) | Host writes next syndrome while UF grow→peel runs |
| **3–4** | Hide PCIe jitter / batching once Phase 3 is wired |
| **1** | Reject for streaming FTQC — stalls QPU on every decode |

Controller handshake (conceptual): `frame_valid` / `frame_ready` on ingest; `obs_valid` / `obs_ready` on egress. Single clock domain with PE mesh until an async FIFO is required at the PCIe clock boundary (Phase 3).

